          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $(f_n)$ be nonnegative measurable functions. Then $$\\int \\liminf_{n\\to\\infty}f_n\\,d\\mu\\le\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty}\\int f_n\\,d\\mu.$$",
