          "quote": "Assume Countable Choice [[def-countable-choice]]. Let $(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)$ be a sigma-finite measure space and let $\\boldsymbol\\omega=(\\omega_1,\\ldots,\\omega_d):X\\to\\mathbb R^d$ be a finite-valued measurable map, where",
